WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.179 --> 00:00:07.459
Speaker 1: The vaccines work so well and enough
people have gotten them that the CDC has announced

00:00:07.459 --> 00:00:13.150
no more outdoor masks in most situations for
vaccinated people.

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:18.700
Now, if that sounds underwhelming or if your
reaction is, you know, most a lot of the country's

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.410
already been doing that.

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:23.350
These guidelines, of course, are for people
who are following CDC guidelines.

00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:27.590
If you've not been following them all along,
then you don't really care what the CDC says.

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:29.550
You're probably not getting vaccinated either.

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:32.040
You're probably you probably have been letting
it rip.

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:39.460
But for those of us who care what the CDC
says and who have been following Joe Biden's

00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:41.240
agreement with CDC guidelines.

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:43.160
Remember, these aren't Biden's guidelines.

00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:46.760
They are just Joe Biden saying, I will listen
to what the health experts say.

00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:55.540
The CDC yesterday announced that outdoor mask
wearing really is not necessary in most situations.

00:00:55.540 --> 00:01:02.070
Now, it's very carefully written Americans
who are fully vaccinated, meaning two weeks

00:01:02.070 --> 00:01:06.760
after your last dose, whether it's one dose
or two doses, two weeks after the last dose,

00:01:06.760 --> 00:01:09.610
at least actually with Jay, maybe longer.

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:13.979
If you're fully vaccinated against coronavirus,
you no longer need to wear a mask outdoors

00:01:13.979 --> 00:01:20.340
while walking, running, hiking, biking alone
or in a small group, including with members

00:01:20.340 --> 00:01:25.860
of your own household masks are still necessary
in crowded outdoor venues like sports stadiums.

00:01:25.860 --> 00:01:27.780
That's what the CDC has said.

00:01:27.780 --> 00:01:30.870
Joe Biden coming out and announcing the same
thing.

00:01:30.870 --> 00:01:37.000
The CDC stopped short of saying if you're
vaccinated, you just never need a mask outdoors.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:42.540
They say that it's still conceivably possible
that you could transmit coronavirus and that

00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:49.600
with unknown vaccination levels in crowds,
it's safer to wear a mask even if vaccinated

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:50.600
in a big crowd.

00:01:50.600 --> 00:01:53.390
Now, I think this makes perfect sense.

00:01:53.390 --> 00:01:57.250
Unfortunately, there are some doom and gloom
ers who are furious.

00:01:57.250 --> 00:01:58.560
And we were live streaming.

00:01:58.560 --> 00:01:59.840
Joe Biden announcing this yesterday.

00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:04.170
And I heard people saying, David, you can
still pass it even if vaccinated.

00:02:04.170 --> 00:02:10.869
Well, yes, you can, but transmission is reduced
by more than 90 percent.

00:02:10.869 --> 00:02:13.000
And outdoors it's almost zero.

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:16.219
Pre vaccination, Dr. Asheesh job leaves.

00:02:16.219 --> 00:02:18.549
One out of a thousand cases were transmitted
outdoors.

00:02:18.549 --> 00:02:21.159
That's before anyone was vaccinated.

00:02:21.159 --> 00:02:25.379
You were really talking about percentages
and a risk level that is lower than the flu

00:02:25.379 --> 00:02:30.329
when you're talking about an increasingly
vaccinated outdoor situation.

00:02:30.329 --> 00:02:31.769
I've been following the guidelines.

00:02:31.769 --> 00:02:37.209
So even though from the beginning I thought
if I'm biking on the bike path, I don't need

00:02:37.209 --> 00:02:38.209
a mask.

00:02:38.209 --> 00:02:42.109
But after getting some dirty looks, yes, the
judgment worked on me and I put the mask on

00:02:42.109 --> 00:02:45.019
when biking or when running or whatever.

00:02:45.019 --> 00:02:51.510
We are now being told very clearly by the
CDC that certainly at least vaccinated people

00:02:51.510 --> 00:02:53.180
do not need to do that.

00:02:53.180 --> 00:02:59.859
Now, the CDC director, Rochelle Walensky,
emphasized a bigger interpretation than the

00:02:59.859 --> 00:03:05.989
narrow wording of the CDC, saying, quote,
We no longer feel that the vaccinated people

00:03:05.989 --> 00:03:11.159
require masks outdoors other than large public
venues, period.

00:03:11.159 --> 00:03:19.159
And one really interesting thing is that the
CDC has also put out a sort of pictograph

00:03:19.159 --> 00:03:24.180
that shows a list of activities, the risk
level if you are unvaccinated and the risk

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:26.379
level if you are fully vaccinated.

00:03:26.379 --> 00:03:31.049
The risk level for fully vaccinated people
is color coded green, meaning low risk for

00:03:31.049 --> 00:03:35.639
every activity, including going to crowded
outdoor events.

00:03:35.639 --> 00:03:39.919
The venue and the recommendation may still
be to put a mask on in that situation, even

00:03:39.919 --> 00:03:41.010
if vaccinated.

00:03:41.010 --> 00:03:46.859
But the CDC making clear if you're vaccinated,
the risk level for a big concert is low.

00:03:46.859 --> 00:03:50.719
The risk level for going inside at restaurants
is still low.

00:03:50.719 --> 00:03:54.479
Now, of course, it will continue to be lower
as more and more people are vaccinated.

00:03:54.479 --> 00:03:58.760
If you individually have a higher risk profile,
then that may not be something you want to

00:03:58.760 --> 00:03:59.760
do right away.

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:03.950
And we're going to talk about that later in
my segment about Joe Rogan's recent comments.

00:04:03.950 --> 00:04:10.040
But hopefully the point here is that hopefully
this will encourage more people to want to

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:11.689
get vaccinated.

00:04:11.689 --> 00:04:16.650
That is increasingly an issue that we are
dealing with in the United States.

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:23.540
While many countries are still having major
supply issues with vaccines in the US, increasingly

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:26.430
the problem is lack of demand.

00:04:26.430 --> 00:04:28.020
It's it's actually tragic.

00:04:28.020 --> 00:04:32.400
So many countries desperate to get vaccines,
they haven't yet been able to get in the US,

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:36.009
more and more states are going to just show
up.

00:04:36.009 --> 00:04:38.730
You don't even need an appointment and they're
still not.

00:04:38.730 --> 00:04:44.550
Filling every slot, so hopefully the word
from the CDC and Biden that the masks can

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:48.820
come off for vaccinated people in almost every
scenario will encourage more people to want

00:04:48.820 --> 00:04:50.110
to get vaccinated.

00:04:50.110 --> 00:04:54.220
The counter point is, if you still don't want
to get vaccinated, you probably don't care

00:04:54.220 --> 00:04:55.849
what the CDC says about masks.

00:04:55.849 --> 00:04:59.080
And that certainly is a source of concern.

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:04.139
Let's now talk about some of the reaction
from the media to Joe Biden's announcement

00:05:04.139 --> 00:06:13.949
of what the CDC has determined regarding masks.

